Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.77,0:04:09.20,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}あおいでった
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.47,0:04:12.01,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}空超えていく
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.26,0:04:14.66,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}握りしめた
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.93,0:04:17.35,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}掌のひらの
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.63,0:04:20.04,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}その中に
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.32,0:04:23.16,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}希望があったんだ
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.41,0:04:32.49,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}目の前に広がる景色  全部が
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.82,0:04:37.55,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}実はちっぼけだったと気ついた
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.11,0:04:42.76,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}例えば君と出逢えば簡単に
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.01,0:04:47.39,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}世界はびっくり変える
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.40,0:04:51.59,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}知らないことだらけで
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.85,0:04:54.32,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}笑えてく
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.58,0:04:57.96,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}またまた先にいけ
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.67,0:05:00.61,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}あかしだ
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.00,0:05:03.48,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}追いかけてた
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.73,0:05:06.14,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}春が遠く
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.44,0:05:08.89,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}譲れない
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.12,0:05:11.65,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}思いも連れて
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.86,0:05:14.32,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}誰も知らない
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.58,0:05:16.98,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}いただきを
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.28,0:05:19.70,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}目指して行く
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.97,0:05:22.78,opjp,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}全てかけて
