Dialogue: 1,0:04:01.36,0:04:03.86,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}脱胎换骨
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.07,0:04:06.56,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}现在在这里
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.77,0:04:09.20,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}超越这
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.47,0:04:12.01,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}湛蓝的天空
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.26,0:04:14.66,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}握住了
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.93,0:04:17.35,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}在掌心中的
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.63,0:04:20.04,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}在那之中
Dialogue: 1,0:04:20.32,0:04:23.16,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}出现了希望
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.41,0:04:32.49,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}发觉到  在眼前展开的景色
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.82,0:04:37.55,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}事实上全都非常渺小
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.11,0:04:42.76,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}如果能跟你相见
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.01,0:04:47.39,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}那么就能简单的改变这个世界
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.40,0:04:51.59,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}在不解和疑惑中
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.85,0:04:54.32,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}微笑带过
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.58,0:04:57.96,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}是再向前一步的
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.67,0:05:00.61,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}证明啊
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.00,0:05:03.48,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}追赶上了
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.73,0:05:06.14,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}春天很遥远
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.44,0:05:08.89,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}不会退让
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.12,0:05:11.65,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}带着回忆
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.86,0:05:14.32,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}无人知晓
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.58,0:05:16.98,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}赌上一切
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.28,0:05:19.70,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}目标顶峰
Dialogue: 1,0:05:19.97,0:05:22.78,opcn,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}{\3c00008C\1c82C0FF}出发
